@hcA1FilesystemErrors
$ #SEFP2 - A1 filesystem error codes#
   0x01 - Unknown error
   0x02 - File, directory or volume not found
   0x03 - Not enough free space on volume to perform operation
   0x04 - The access permission attributes do not allow operation
   0x05 - Specified path does not point to a directory
   0x06 - There already exists a named file with given name
   0x07 - Signed file archive error
   0x08 - Not authenticated / Not supported
   0x09 - File system is formatting



  ~Go to main screen~@Contents@

@hcA2FilesystemErrors
$ #SEFP2 - A2 filesystem error codes#
   0x01 - The loader does not support the property
   0x02 - The property is read only
   0x03 - The property value is invalid
   0x04 - The access permission attributes do not allow operation
   0x05 - The file system is busy formatting
   0x06 - The path does not exist
   0x07 - The path already exists
   0x08 - The path is read only
   0x09 - Insufficient space
   0x0A - The directory is not empty
   0x0B - The specified access restriction is invalid
   0x0C - Could not find any file system configuration from the platform software in the flash
   0x0D - The file does not exist
   0x0E - Failed to change directory
   0x0F - Failed to set new CH mod
   0x10 - Failed to get the current directory
   0x11 - Failed to open a file in the file system
   0x12 - Failed to read the stat from file
   0x13 - Failed to list volumes
   0x14 - No free space left
   0x15 - Failed to close a file in the file system
   0x16 - Failed to close the directory
   0x17 - Failed to remove a file from the file system
   0x18 - Failed to rename a file in the file system
   0x19 - Failed to create a new directory in the file system
   0x1A - Failed to remove a directory from the file system
   0x1B - Failed to write a file to the file system
   0x1C - The state of the SFA programming is incorrect



  ~Go to main screen~@Contents@
